# PyCharm
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/


# ignore large data files
**/*.pkl
**/embeddings.csv
# Building-block masks are required to reproduce arXiv 2511.19264 — the
# generic **/*.pkl rule above would silently drop them.
!src/synflownet/data/building_blocks/precomputed_bb_masks_enamine_bbs.pkl

# Overcomplete-SAE derived artifacts — regenerable from embeddings.csv via run_all.sh.
# The small result tables ARE tracked; these large intermediates are not.
src/interpretability/overcomplete_saes/cache/
src/interpretability/overcomplete_saes/**/latents.npz
src/interpretability/overcomplete_saes/**/*.pt

# Internal steering experiment planning — contains Montility dataset IDs, S3
# pipeline paths, and unreleased-program references. Keep out of the public repo.
src/interpretability/steering_experiments/STEERING_EXPERIMENT_PLAN_v2.md
src/interpretability/steering_experiments/*.pdf

# Training runs under steering_experiments. Ignored WHOLESALE, configs included.
# Two reasons: the artifacts (46 MB checkpoints, molecule DBs, tfevents) are
# large and regenerable; and the configs name an internal program target and
# compound series (see the potency run), which the steering plan requires be
# kept out of external outputs. Also ignores extracted embeddings.
src/interpretability/steering_experiments/run_*/
src/interpretability/steering_experiments/emb_*/

# Per-molecule dumps from the steering sweeps: one row per generated molecule, up to 93 MB each
# and >500 MB in total. Regenerable by re-running the arm (phase09/run_*.sh), and every number in
# PAPER_RESULTS.md is computed from the per-CONDITION summaries and verdict JSONs, which ARE
# tracked. Keeping the dumps out is what makes the rest committable at all.
src/interpretability/steering_experiments/phase09/results*/*molecules*.csv
src/interpretability/steering_experiments/phase09/results*/embeddings*.npy

# Unpublished follow-on work and local experiment scaffolding. Versioned elsewhere; excluded
# here so a `git add -A` cannot pull them in. This repository serves the arXiv 2511.19264 code
# citation, which points at src/interpretability.
src/interpretability/paper_results/
src/interpretability/steering_experiments/
